--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Files in this package derived from the upstream sources, and modified
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

lib/src/tools/browser_tools.dart
    The tool names and their broad shapes follow the @playwright/mcp server
    of the upstream project (browser_navigate, browser_snapshot,
    browser_click, ...). The implementations are written from scratch in
    Dart against this port's public API, and the tool set is smaller; the
    README lists what is missing and why.

lib/src/tools/snapshot.dart
    The idea of a role/name/reference page snapshot comes from
    @playwright/mcp. The DOM walk, the role and name computation and the
    reference stamping are this port's own, because the upstream snapshot is
    built on an ARIA implementation this port has not finished.
